<title>GERMANY: Buba says 6-mo monetary capital formation 5.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Buba says 6-mo monetary capital formation 5.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank gave data as follows (annualised rates)</p>
<p>Monetary capital formation</p>
<p>in six months to November</p>
<p>	  vs six months to Oct	5.4 pct   vs    5.2 pct</p>
<p>Bank lending to private</p>
<p>sector in six mos to Nov</p>
<p>	  vs six months to Oct	5.9 pct   vs    5.6 pct</p>
<p>M3 money supply in six</p>
<p>months to November</p>
<p>	  vs six months to Oct	  5.5 pct   vs    6.2 pct</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
